extends ../../../layouts/master.pug

block title
  title Non-Degree Course of Study | Ministerial Training at NBC
  meta(name='description', content='Prepare for ordination or deepen your Christian education through NBC’s Non-Degree Course of Study for ministry leaders and learners.')

block header
  include ../../../components/header.pug

block content
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.nav-breadcrums.bg-gray-100
      .container
        .breadcrumb
          ul
            li.home
              a(href='/index-4.html') Home
            li
              a(href='/programs/') Programs
            li
              span Non-Degree Course of Study
  section.section-box
    .banner-hero.banner-head-image(style='background: url(/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_332409626.jpeg); background-size: cover; background-position: center bottom;')
      .container
        .text-center
          h1.text-heading-1.color-white.mt-30
            | Non-Degree Course of Study
  section.section-box.mt-50.mb-50
    .container
      .content-detail
        .row
          .col-lg-2
          .col-lg-8
            p.text-body-lead.mb-30
              | Are you preparing for ordination in the Church of the Nazarene or another denomination? Do you want to learn more about the Christian faith than what you learned in VBS? Take college-level courses now to pave the way into your future.
        .row
          .col-lg-12
            .row
              .col-lg-6
                p.text-body-text.mb-30
                  | The Non-Degree Course of Study (NCOS) is an eight-week, video-based ministerial training curriculum designed especially for those seeking ordination in the USA/Canada Region of the Church of the Nazarene. This course may also benefit students who are preparing for ordination in other denominations.
                p.text-body-text.mb-30
                  | This easily accessible, high-quality program is also for those who are ministering now, especially in diverse contexts. Anyone seeking education in Christian studies (16 years or older, proficient in English) is also eligible to enroll. 
                p.text-body-text.mb-30
                  | The NCOS curriculum consists of 21 courses developed by the Church of the Nazarene’s educational office. Every course is presented through online instruction in the Canvas Learning Management system and is facilitated by a qualified instructor. There are eight weeks of instruction with flexibility in delivery formats and assessments of learning throughout the program. 
              .col-lg-6.d-flex.justify-content-center.flex-column
                img.img-responsive.bdr-10.mt-10.ml-10(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_678382560.jpeg', alt='Student studying')
    .container.mt-50
      .row
        .col-lg-10.mx-auto
          .bg-6.box-newsletter.position-relative
            .row
              .col-lg-5.col-md-7
                span.text-body-capitalized.color-gray-500.text-uppercase application
                h4.text-heading-2.mb-10.mt-10 Start your journey with NBC today.
                p.text-body-text.mb-30
                  | Does this sound like what you've been searching for? NBC is ready to be your education partner for now and the future.
                a.btn.btn-black.mt-50.mr-20(href='https://ncos.nbc.edu/') Learn More
                a.btn.btn-black.mt-50.icon-arrow(href='/apply/') Apply
              .col-lg-7.col-md-5.mt-30.mt-lg-0.mt-md-30.mt-sm-30.position-relative.text-end
                img.img-responsive.img-newsletter(src='/assets/imgs/stock/AdobeStock_968974436_vertical.jpeg', alt='Man sitting on stairs using a laptop')
